# Alembic migrations

Schema changes for the product API. The initial revision creates the six
tables described in `docs/development-requirements.md` (products, categories,
sizes, colors, product_sizes, product_colors).

Run migrations from the project root (the URL is read from `.env`):

    alembic upgrade head

Generate a new revision from the models:

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change"

Note: a healthy database container is not the same as a migrated database.
Migrations run separately from `docker compose up`.
